    {
        "id": "f5",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Dashboard Monitoring",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "# Dashboard 2.0 Monitoring Flow\n\nThis flow showcases the Dashboard 2.0 widgets for AlephScript monitoring:\n\n- **Bot Registry**: Displays all connected bots and their status\n- **Room Tester**: Interactive widget for testing room operations\n- **Stream Monitor**: Real-time visualization of message streams\n- **Configuration Panel**: Central configuration management\n\n## Dashboard Features:\n- Real-time bot status monitoring\n- Interactive room management\n- Message flow visualization\n- System health dashboards",
        "env": []
    },
